    "encrypted": "false",
    "long_instructions": "## Revisiting your Vision\r\n\r\nYour project is back! Now is the time to refine your webpage until it truly matches your vision. You get to decide how you want to work with AI Tutor as a collaborator.\r\n\r\n**Do This:**\r\n- **Iterate:** Keep updating your webpage using AI Tutor as your collaborator.\r\n- **(Optional) Reset:** Want to start over? Use the <i class=\"fa-history fa-solid\"></i> Version History tab to reset to the Initial Version\r\n\r\n**When are you finished?** This level is open-ended! Unlike previous steps, there is no single task to complete. Spend as much time as you like building and changing. **You decide when you’re done.**\r\n\r\n> **Tip:** Use the **Share** button in the upper-left to send your page to a friend, or **Remix** to save it to your project gallery.",
    "submittable": "false",
    "disable_edit_run_for_submission": "false",
